so the inequalities are reversed. The same bootstrap resamples serve all four
estimators, and \code{\link[=evaluate]{evaluate()}} returns all of them in its \code{bootstrap} element.
\code{\link[=tune]{tune()}} and \code{\link[=compare]{compare()}} score the out-of-bag rows only.

